00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.399
<i> It starts from the cloud.</i>

00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:42.335
<i> A lightning leader
 will descend.</i>

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.871
<i>The speed up there is about one
 tenth the velocity of light.</i>

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.839
